@BenRepoAPI_HostAddress = http://localhost:5166

GET {{BenRepoAPI_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

###

### 1. Get Applicant Details (via ApplicantController -> eLabharthiAPI /send-otp)
POST {{BenRepoAPI_HostAddress}}/api/Applicant/GetApplicantDetails
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "portal_id": 0,
  "mobile_no": "9876543210",
  "deviceid": "DEVICE123456",
  "session": "2024-2025"
}

###

### 2. Get Applicant Details (via PortalController)
POST {{BenRepoAPI_HostAddress}}/api/Portal/GetApplicantDetails
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "portal_id": 1,
  "mobile_no": "9876543210",
  "deviceid": "DEVICE123456",
  "session": "2024-2025",
  "client_key": "CLIENT_KEY_SECRET_789"
}

### 3. Verify OTP (Single a_Id)
POST {{BenRepoAPI_HostAddress}}/api/Applicant/VerifyOtp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "a_Id": 23,
  "mobileNo": "9097372728",
  "otp": "139904",
  "deviceId": "DEV123",
  "session": "2025"
}

###

### 4. Verify OTP (Multiple a_Id Array)
POST {{BenRepoAPI_HostAddress}}/api/Applicant/VerifyOtp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "a_Id": [23, 24],
  "mobileNo": "9097372728",
  "otp": "139904",
  "deviceId": "DEV123",
  "session": "2025"
}

###

### 5. Send OTP to Mobile (via OtpController)
POST {{BenRepoAPI_HostAddress}}/api/Otp/SendOtp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "mobile": "9876543210",
  "deviceId": "DEV123456"
}

###

### 6. Verify OTP on Mobile (via OtpController)
POST {{BenRepoAPI_HostAddress}}/api/Otp/VerifyOtp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "mobileNo": "9876543210",
  "otp": "123456"
}

###

### 7. Send OTP via Sms route alias
POST {{BenRepoAPI_HostAddress}}/api/Sms/SendOtp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "mobile": "9876543210"
}

###

### 8. Verify OTP via Sms route alias
POST {{BenRepoAPI_HostAddress}}/api/Sms/VerifyOtp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "mobile": "9876543210",
  "otp": "123456"
}

###

### 9. User Registration - Successful Registration
POST {{BenRepoAPI_HostAddress}}/api/User/Register
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Perwez Akhter",
  "mobileNo": "9876543210",
  "interests": [1, 3, 5]
}

###

### 10. User Registration - Deduplication of Interests
POST {{BenRepoAPI_HostAddress}}/api/User/Register
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Perwez Akhter",
  "mobileNo": "9876543211",
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "interests": [1, 1, 3, 3, 5]
}

###

### 11. User Registration - Duplicate Mobile (Expect 409 Conflict)
POST {{BenRepoAPI_HostAddress}}/api/User/Register
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Duplicate User",
  "mobileNo": "9876543210",
  "interests": [2, 4]
}

###

### 12. Insert Broadcast Message (via MessageController)
POST {{BenRepoAPI_HostAddress}}/api/Message/InsertBroadcastMessage
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "message_head": "Public Health Alert: Dengue Prevention Advisory",
  "message_body": "Health Department Advisory: Please ensure no stagnant clean water accumulates around your premises. Use mosquito nets and report any persistent fever to your nearest PHC.",
  "validity_in_minutes": 1440,
  "is_active": "Y",
  "photo1path": "https://health.bihar.gov.in/images/dengue_advisory.jpg",
  "entryby": "Admin"
}

###

### 13. Get Broadcast Messages (Verify inserted message)
POST {{BenRepoAPI_HostAddress}}/api/Message/GetBroadCastMessage
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

###

### 14. Insert Interest-Wise Message (via MessageController, without portal_id or mobile)
POST {{BenRepoAPI_HostAddress}}/api/Message/InsertInterestWiseMessage
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "interest_id": 5,
  "message_head": "Agriculture Advisory: Kharif Crop Protection",
  "message_body": "Department Advisory for Farmers: Recommended pest control measures for Kharif crops during erratic rainfall periods. Visit your local Block Agriculture Officer for subsidized fertilizers.",
  "validity_in_minutes": 10000,
  "is_active": "Y",
  "photo1path": "https://health.bihar.gov.in/images/crop_pest_control.jpg",
  "youtubeurl": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=samplecropvideo",
  "entryby": "Admin"
}

###

### 15. Fetch Interest-Wise Message History (Verify inserted interest message)
POST {{BenRepoAPI_HostAddress}}/api/Message/GetInterestWiseMessage
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "DeviceID": "DEVICE123456",
  "interest_id": "5"
}



